<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB sets 13-week bill auction for Thursday.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB sets 13-week bill auction for Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) on Tuesday set a Dutch auction for Thursday offering eight billion crowns in 13-week central bank liquidity bills.</p>
<p>The maximum gross yield on bids was set at 13.5 percent, with a minimum price is 967,000 crowns, on bills with a one million crown nominal value, the CNB said.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
